      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Examples of that would be things :\n        ° httpd as a process that is \n          running on that particular server\n\n        ° httpd, of course, would have \n          some memory pages\n\n        ° We have some users. \n          You could see that we have the\n          user, bobby, that is defined on \n          this particular server\n\n        ° we have a file like, at\n          the /mnt/ directory, \n          there's a file called foo",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Examples of that would be things :\n        ° httpd as a process that is \n          running on that particular server\n\n        ° httpd, of course, would have \n          some memory pages\n\n        ° We have some users. \n          You could see that we have the\n          user, bobby, that is defined on \n          this particular server\n\n        ° we have a file like, at\n          the /mnt/ directory, \n          there's a file called foo",
