      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790185131824,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Now, what namespaces are like partitions :\n   - there are partitions very specifically, \n     of system resources :\n        ° like processes, \n        ° like memory, \n        ° like users \n     and \n        ° files \n   - there are different kinds of namespaces\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Now, what namespaces are like partitions :\n   - there are partitions very specifically, \n     of system resources :\n        ° like processes, \n        ° like memory, \n        ° like users \n     and \n        ° files \n   - there are different kinds of namespaces\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790185131491,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1117,
