      "updated": 1790185131824,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> So let's go and label these namespaces",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> So let's go and label these namespaces",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790185131516,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 7153,
      "versionNonce": 1021432430,
      "index": "c00r",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "UOWUnXAjQEUL17k7g4uM0",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -373.32346594585283,
      "y": -34203.8095238096,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#99e9f2",
      "width": 1151.13330078125,
      "height": 495,
      "seed": 304320434,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790185131824,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> And, because they are partitioned, \n    ==> they're completely separate\n\n    ==> So, what this means right now is \n        that, I could have httpd that is \n        running on my main server, \n        and then in a different namespace,\n            --> I could have a different version \n                of httpd, that is completely independent of the \n                httpd instance, on the server itself, \n                in the other partitions that I have.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> And, because they are partitioned, \n    ==> they're completely separate\n\n    ==> So, what this means right now is \n        that, I could have httpd that is \n        running on my main server, \n        and then in a different namespace,\n            --> I could have a different version \n                of httpd, that is completely independent of the \n                httpd instance, on the server itself, \n                in the other partitions that I have.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1790185131516,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
