      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> There are other Kernel features that we are available, \n    that sort of drive containerization :\n        ° Both are security related features :\n            \n            - SELinux or Security Enhanced Linux\n        \n            - Secure Computing mode commonly called SecComp ",
