      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> We now need to identify which process it is \n   that we're going to be starting\n    ==> this is what metadata is so important\n    --> the entry point is that container image \n        metadata, and it describes the command\n        that is to be executed whenever a\n        container is started from that\n        particular image",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> We now need to identify which process it is \n   that we're going to be starting\n    ==> this is what metadata is so important\n    --> the entry point is that container image \n        metadata, and it describes the command\n        that is to be executed whenever a\n        container is started from that\n        particular image",
